seal stays broken, partial elder trio progress expires after 24 hours and its elders respawn, the guild count resets only at 5 of 5 into a new cycle and the Elite door once unlocked stays open for good; and the first-break extras (base signature loot, the per-champion trophy and the Warden starter kit) pay once ever per player per seal, the first time that player personally breaks the seal in any cycle, while the guild-hall plaque record and the Sealbreakers title stay single historical events and the Raid Village Standard exception is untouched. 0.5.7 adds the claims-chest Back control (BB-18) - the /bossrewards chest gains a Back arrow in bottom-row slot 48 returning to the ExcelMenu Server Menu via the fleet opener, with the fleet failure line if the menu cannot open; every other behaviour is exactly as 0.5.6 shipped it. 0.5.7.1 corrects the BuildInfo build stamp - the boot Build line now carries the true build ID for this version in all three fingerprint homes; no gameplay behaviour changes from 0.5.7.
